{
  "id": "6a6f22b89e1596315c025e52",
  "title": "ルーティン駆動生活",
  "created": 1785668281,
  "updated": 1785668334,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b89e1596315c025e52",
      "text": "ルーティン駆動生活",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf34c",
      "text": "from [2026/08/02][atohs.icon]",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668302
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf34d",
      "text": "ルーティン駆動生活",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668286
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf34e",
      "text": "というのを考えていた",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf34f",
      "text": "\t「これを定期的に続けていれば人生が良くなる」と思えるものを、毎日やる",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf350",
      "text": "\t毎日、というのが大事",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf351",
      "text": "\t毎日できないよ〜という場合は、毎日できるように小さい単位でやる",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf352",
      "text": "\t\t[ベイビーステップ]",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668334
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf353",
      "text": "\t\tたとえば、本を1日5分だけ読む、とか",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf354",
      "text": "\t\t負荷は徐々に増やしていっても良い",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf355",
      "text": "\t\tきつくなってきたら、時には減らしていっても良い",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf356",
      "text": "\tルーティンがひとつだけだと楽しくないので、複数あると良いかもしれない",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf357",
      "text": "\tルーティンをどうやってえらぶ？",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf358",
      "text": "\t[健康で文化的な最低限度の生活]を目指してピックすると良い気がしている",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668325
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf359",
      "text": "\t健康",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf35a",
      "text": "\t\t運動をしよう！",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf35b",
      "text": "\t\tランニング？",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf35c",
      "text": "\t\t筋トレ？",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf35d",
      "text": "\t文化",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf35e",
      "text": "\t\t読書をしよう！",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf35f",
      "text": "\t\t映画を見るとかでも良いかもしれない",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf360",
      "text": "\t\tやりたいと思っているけどやれていないこと、というのが良さそう",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf361",
      "text": "\t生活",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf362",
      "text": "\t\t家事とかする？",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf363",
      "text": "\t\tお金に関することでも良い",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf364",
      "text": "\t\t将来のための勉強とか",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf365",
      "text": "\t\t副業のための作業とか",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf366",
      "text": "\t[アイゼンハワーマトリクス]でいうところの、緊急度は低いが重要度が高いタスクというのを、ここでやっていくイメージ",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf367",
      "text": "\t\tそういうのって、得てして締切とか終わりがないやつが多い気がしているし",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf368",
      "text": "\t\t斧を研ぐ時間、といっても良いかもしれない",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf369",
      "text": "\t\tあるいは、水をやる時間、種をまく時間",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f22b800000000005bf36a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1785668281,
      "updated": 1785668281
    }
  ]
}